# Studio — Operate
THESIS: Code and its geometric consequence share one calm workspace.
OWN-WORLD: The seventh grounded direction, a modern Polish school mathematics workbook: cool off-white paper, bottle green ink, warm clay secondary drawings, a sober sans and true monospace code. No simulated paper texture. A small geometric turtle is the signature.
STORY: Write → run or step → inspect the drawing → learn from examples and reference → practice and share.
FIRST VIEWPORT: Brand and persistent three-tab navigation; studio title with local-save status; execution toolbar; code and gridded drawing side by side; a horizontal examples shelf below.
FORM: seed:8cdc337b15bcf75f. Code-led. Familiar buttons, segmented mode switch, line-numbered editor, native canvas manipulation. Mobile stacks code and canvas.
Grounded candidates considered: school exercise sheet; museum education labels; geometry textbook; botanical field notes; children's construction game; Polish educational publishing; modern mathematics workbook (assigned seventh).
Challenger judgments: datamatics declined (monochrome weakens colored geometry), kept data precision; Japanese density competitive on scanning, declined on learner clarity, kept compact toolbar; streaming wall declined (code needs stable work areas), kept preview-led examples; timetable declined (rake impairs editor), kept alignment; Crouwel competitive on geometry, declined on text clarity, kept visible drawing construction grid; transit declined (map navigation unnecessary), kept clear spatial axes.
User explicitly delegated decisions and prohibited interviews/approval pages. No decision page or interview is used. No raster assets needed. In-thread finish review substitutes for unavailable delegated agents.
EOF
